# The Python image-matching service is a separate app, deployed on its
# own (Render/Fly.io — see DEPLOY.md), never on Vercel. Without this,
# Vercel's import scanner sees requirements.txt and app/main.py in here
# and treats the repo as a multi-service monorepo needing its own
# service-by-service configuration, which this project doesn't want or need.
services/
